    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "35f555aa_63ff1d79",
        "filename": "common/lid_switch.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 146,
      "author": {
        "id": 1104704
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-07T15:56:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As I explained in https://b.corp.google.com/issues/369509279#comment5, it will not work: lid_angle_change() is called only when the lid angle is reliable. When the user closes the lid, the lid angle is **not** reliable, since the lid is moving. Si lid_angle_change() will never/seldom get called when the lid is closing.",
      "revId": "9286b797ef3c890d2296c2b29a78d4d771d1255f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
